Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||06-13-2001||03:27 AM||||i know he can be annoying (he's my younger brother) but no one deserves this...<P>(if its in the wrong forum, let me know and i will stop adding to it)<P>today, my brother adam (farfromlosin) got his 67 vw beetle (gave it to him for his borthday, i did!) broken. not broken into, because there is a point to this, but someone actually pummelled the whole body with a brick, intentionally broke all the windows, hammered on the top of the carbeurator - then, went inside, pulled off the stereo faceplate, broke it in half, crammed some stuff into the cd slot, continued bashing things with the brick. by the time he got out there, it was sitting low on one side and there was a big pile of green paint chips/dust and brick dust on the ground around it. the car is nearly totaled, undriveable because his NEW 2800 mile engine had everything hammered into a lump, and all the gagues and interior are smashed. nothing was taken, everything was SMASHED and left in a pile on the passenger seat. i feel so bad for him because he was working so hard to get money to improve his ride, so please, a moment of silence. <P>P.S. the school lot it was in had security, they said they didn't pay attention to the kids in the car. we filed a police report, he said "so, it's a bug" i felt bad when someone stole my fiero, but i feel worse this time. only i get to mess with my brother. sorry for venting, and thanks for the bandwidth||||reg||1
Z||000001||fierospeeder||06-13-2001||03:42 AM||||im a fellow beetle lover, got a 74.  The people who done that deserve the death penalty.<P>Must be the worst feeling when he just got the car and havn't driven it that much.<P>See if your school has any security cameras outside.  Someone must have it in for your brother or you.  Do people know that you gave him your car.  Listen to rumors see if you get any clues.||||reg||1
